WEBVTT

00:01.829 --> 00:04.048
AI CV Studio: Keep every job in one place.

00:04.048 --> 00:07.854
Open the Job tracker

00:07.854 --> 00:11.805
Add a job: title, company and the advert

00:11.805 --> 00:15.859
Save it. It lands in Saved

00:15.859 --> 00:18.969
Move it along as you hear back

00:18.969 --> 00:21.776
Free to start: Never lose track again.
